GRAMMAR.md §7.1 (DECISIONS 439): a template that is not a relative path of non-empty segments: //, a .. or . segment, a trailing /, a leading /, an empty template.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    admin: "../admin"
    web: "../web"
    wiki: "../wiki"
    docs: "../docs"
